# Every path has an owner. Last matching pattern wins, so order matters:
# general rules first, specific overrides below.

* @forksunny

# Infrastructure and CI change blast radius, not just behaviour —
# in a team these would belong to a platform group, not the service owners.
/infra/        @forksunny
/.github/      @forksunny

# Money and audit paths. Separate entry so the ownership is explicit
# in the file rather than implied by the catch-all above.
/services/payment-service/  @forksunny
